The code has the checks $Z_1Z_2$ and $Z_2Z_3$, indexed by $j\in\{1,2\}$; round $x\in\{a,b,c,d\}$ measures them with outcomes $x_j$, has input virtual syndromes $s^{x,\mathrm{in}}_j$, and provides the virtual detectors $x_j+s^{x,\mathrm{in}}_j$ together with the output virtual syndrome map $s^{x}_j=x_j$.
The CNOT realization has no physical outcomes; since it maps $Z$ on the target block to $Z\otimes Z$ and leaves $Z$ on the control block unchanged, its output virtual syndrome map is $s^c_j=s^a_j$ and $s^d_j=s^a_j+s^b_j$.
